  "$comment": "Event-to-sound manifest template. files = round-robin pool; layers = play all with their own delayMs (negative leads); synth keys map to the generators in references/web-audio.md; haptic arrays are vibration patterns, {during,end} for gesture-tracked sounds; duck names a profile; gainByDamage and byDamage use 'at most' buckets. File names are placeholders for the sounds you choose from assets/sound-sources.json."
